# Migrated from the refusal of slice 293 (docs/LMX_semantics.ru.md :467, "Нет ни аргумента, ни допустимого дефолта — обычный отказ вызова").
# The author's decision of 2026-11-16 cancels it: x has no value in its declaration and no argument; the call runs, x holds
# «T без инициализации», and the body reads only y.  Entry 7; 81 names the failing check.
fn: e (int: x; int: y 7) int
    return: y
end: e
int: code 7
if: e(y := 3) != 3
    code := 81
---
send: exit(exit_code: code; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
